WEBVTT

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:07.040
It possesses enormous power,
and brings endless pleasure

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:11.010
and destruction  to those who are destined.

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:12.760
The Witchblade.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.760
At this moment, one woman has awakened.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:33.460
Just before the shot, my chest feels like it's gonna tear open

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.050
I shout out countless times, break out

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:42.240
It's not over, rush through the endless night

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:47.530
Hot blood flows through my body

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:51.240
The moment it ultimately rots away

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:57.840
it's all over, fragments of an empty dream come to mind

00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:03.340
I can never go back, I can't remember a thing

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:08.880
I've been reduced to struggling, and my voice won't carry

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:12.390
Uncontrollable impulses

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:19.310
Give me your XTC, let me feel it one more time

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:26.530
This body heats up, and I shout out your name in the darkness

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:33.530
Give me your XTC, I don't need false love

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:36.710
I will accept it, sin and punishment

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:43.280
Slash through the destiny I've been set up with, Blade

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:47.980
"Movement"

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:52.690
Wow! It's so fluffy! Is this what a suite is?

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:56.190
The suites in this hotel
are far more luxurious.

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:59.780
Here. Your things, which we retrieved,
and a simple change of clothes.

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:05.290
For any pressing needs.

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:10.830
Lodgings are being looked for,
so please bear with the hotel for now.

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:13.840
I'm on the same floor, in Room 15.

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:15.750
You're here to keep an eye on us, huh?

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:18.470
Please say, "here to assist."

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:21.760
I'll be going now. But don't
hesitate to call if you need anything.

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:23.760
Good night, Rihoko-san.

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:25.140
Good night!

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:29.020
Hey! Hands off that!
Sorry...

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:40.400
Mom, are you going to work
at Segawa-san's company?

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:44.410
Yeah. But he's not the boss.

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:47.740
What kind of company is it?
A big one.

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:49.040
But what about the police?

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:52.210
Won't the Child Welfare people come again?

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:55.630
Don't worry. We can live together!

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:57.750
Hurray!

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:02.680
It seems like so much time
has passed since we came to Tokyo.

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:08.770
Oh, Mom!

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:15.690
Let's order food! Something really expensive!

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:17.690
No, we can't waste money!

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:20.320
It's okay, the company is paying!

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.110
You'll be fired.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.950
It's fine!

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:29.200
So yummy!

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:31.870
I wonder how they make this sauce?

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:35.630
Speaking of which, we haven't
had your cooking in a while.

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:38.340
When we find a permanent place,
I'll cook lots for you!

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:43.220
Yeah! No one can complain
and we won't cause anyone trouble!

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:47.550
I can't wait! It'll be the first time...
a house for just the two of us!

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:50.270
Yep! From now on, it's just the two of us!

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:51.270
Yeah!

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:54.230
Atta way to go!

00:03:57.690 --> 00:04:02.440
And on the 1st floor
where the photographer lives

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:08.490
is a lady named Mariko-san.
She's sorta scary, but she's nice.

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:13.370
She let me spend the night,
and she made me breakfast.

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:17.790
Really? Then, we'll have
to go thank her tomorrow.

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:19.340
Yeah.

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:35.690
Do you have an answer?
Will you accept? Or not?

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:40.070
I'll do it. I will.

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:44.570
I'll never be separated from her again.

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:58.290
It's been a long time.

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:00.250
Now why would you be calling me?

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:04.010
The Witchblade...
It seems a wearer has appeared.

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:05.380
It seems so.

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:07.380
You don't need to hide it.

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:12.180
Controlling the Witchblade is
impossible for you... for Douji Industries.

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:15.600
I believe you need my help.

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:19.730
From you, the individual?
Or as an NSWF employee?

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:21.480
Either.

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:24.740
And it'll be a repeat of six years ago.

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:28.450
You still remember what
happened that long ago?

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:30.870
The truth never fades.

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:35.000
But I'm sorry, we still
haven't located the Witchblade.

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:37.750
But I thank you for calling. Goodbye.

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:39.170
Reiji!

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:45.510
After all this time...
she's after the Witchblade?

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:51.890
I won't let you have it this time, Reina!

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:01.810
No luck?

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:06.400
Takayama isn't that easy.
But there's no mistake about it.

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:09.860
Douji has the Witchblade.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:13.450
What do you suppose the wearer is like?

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:14.740
Good question...

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:19.040
Well, no need to rush.
We'll encounter her in time. I'm sure of it.

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:21.830
Yes, you're right.

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:28.380
Doctor, you should be leaving. Tomorrow is...

00:06:28.470 --> 00:06:29.510
Yes.

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:32.140
I'll clean up for you.

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:34.720
All right, thank you.

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:37.930
Please take care, Dr. Sohou.

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:39.940
You too.

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:51.820
Reina-sama...

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:03.880
Good morning, you two!

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:05.790
If you're going out, I'll drive!

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:08.800
Good morning, Segawa-san!

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:11.430
Right this way, Rihoko-san.
Thank you!

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:17.390
Hey! This is a private matter!
Don't follow us! Come on, Riko!

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:19.770
I'm your bodyguard!
I don't need

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:24.020
Mom, hurry!
Please, get in.

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:28.940
Oh? To thank her for
letting you stay the night?

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:30.900
Do you know where it is?

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:34.740
Of course! Just leave
everything to me from now on!

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:39.830
Hey, now !
Okay! I like you, Segawa-san!
You talk to me like an adult!

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:42.370
Well, you are a fine lady, Rihoko-san!

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:44.460
Thank you!

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:55.640
This one has good volume, too!
My mom has bigger ones.

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:57.800
I'd love to see  Eh?!

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:01.730
Hello! Umm...

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:05.900
Oh, you must be Rihoko-Chan!
I heard about you!

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:08.770
Which means...
Err...

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:13.610
Oh! Rihoko's mama! I've heard all about you!

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:17.740
Just like I pictured you!
Super cute! Super pretty!

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:21.160
It's so good to meet you! Sooo good!

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:23.000
H-Hi...

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:25.830
Such a fine mom!
Umm...

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:29.670
Oh, that's fine too.
Yes, yes! Call me Chou-san

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:33.880
Umm, pardon me for asking,
but are you the husband?

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:38.640
Husband? Missy's? As if!

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:42.060
My criteria are whether
she looks good in a bikini!

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:44.850
She used to wear really skimpy ones before,

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:46.770
but she sleeps with a belly band these days!

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:52.900
You mean Mariko-san?
Yes. She's out right now, though.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.820
Are you a resident here, too?

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:02.240
Umm... Are the rooms here for rent?

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:07.750
Well, yeah, but it's a mixed residential.
It's not really made for living.

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:10.460
But someone moved out,
so there's a room available...

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:11.340
Eh?!

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:16.010
Well, the rent is cheap, but there's no bath.

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:17.840
I'll take it!

00:09:17.930 --> 00:09:19.840
Huh?!

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:21.220
I want to rent it!

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:23.180
Yeah! I agree!

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:27.390
They're taking a long time...

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:32.980
So much material, but nothing seems to fit...

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:39.240
Even if the serial murders
include a bunch of NSWF employees,

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:41.580
I still gotta connect it all...

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:46.080
Crap!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:53.800
Guess my only choice is to get inside...

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:58.800
But it's not like I can ask
for someone's ID card...

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:08.180
So you already know that
the Witchblade has appeared, too.

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:13.820
Yes. And that sisters were
killed by Douji's I-Weapons.

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:17.780
It's sad. Very sad...

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:21.700
But they weren't much at all if they fell

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:25.450
to the likes of I-Weapons and X-Cons...

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:28.710
Especially since we are the ones
who will possess the Witchblade,

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:32.250
the most powerful thing
on the face of this Earth.

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:35.750
We must not let Douji
get ahold of the Witchblade.

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:40.300
Furthermore, we cannot allow
any more of the sisters to be killed.

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:43.850
And I'm sure you can do these two things.

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:46.060
I understand.

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:47.770
I'm counting on you.

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:52.730
I trust that what happened
in the past will not occur again.

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:55.940
Of course not, Father.

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:04.910
Daughter of mine. You are the one
most worthy of the Witchblade...

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:18.380
What? Live here?!

00:11:18.460 --> 00:11:23.130
Umm, I know we just met,
but please let us live here!

00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:24.550
Please!

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:29.310
Wow! Finally, this building will
have something pretty to look at!

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:31.890
I'll draw up a contract, Missy

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:33.770
You can't rent a room!

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:36.940
Missy...

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:41.990
No children allowed!
They're noisy, and make messes!

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:44.240
Besides, I rent to businesses!

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:47.740
Lies! We're all individuals!

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:50.750
Yeah, and that's why
the rent payment's so slow!

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:55.380
Please! I promise to pay the rent on time!

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:59.920
Mariko-san! I promise I'll be quiet,
and I'll keep the room clean

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:01.720
No means no!

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:04.880
Why?!
Because the landlord says so!

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:06.850
Hey, I worked hard on that!

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:08.430
That's so unfair!

00:12:08.510 --> 00:12:11.640
That's right. And if you
don't like it, then get out!

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:12.930
What're you doing?!

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:16.150
Who'd want to rent from
a mean old hag like you?!

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:17.610
Mom!

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:19.610
Mean old hag?!

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:22.820
You over-developed bitch!
Hey, now!

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:24.900
Look who's talking!
Mom! Stop!

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:28.490
Annoying girl!
You whiny old hag!

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:30.950
How dare you?!
How dare you?!

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:34.080
Masane-san!

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:42.380
This is the worst... All the signs are bad...

00:12:45.010 --> 00:12:49.100
You actually think she's so cute... that kid.

00:12:49.180 --> 00:12:51.060
Don't be silly!

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:55.980
But never mind that. We're being evicted.
The city's redeveloping here.

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:58.480
We have one year before
they demolish the building.

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:00.940
What?! No way!

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:03.780
Dammit! The government's so selfish!

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:10.370
Gee... So this building's gonna
be torn down. I can't believe it...

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:27.970
Don't run away... I'm just going
to warm you up a little... Zap!

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:42.690
Zap!

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:47.530
I'll warm you up... Zap!

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:56.000
Damn! The same method again!
And what a way to kill...

00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:59.540
Yup, that's not the work of a human.

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:01.710
Are you sayin' it's some monster?!

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:06.210
Huh?! Isn't that why you're in charge
and bossing everyone around?

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:09.760
Are you callin' me bossy?!

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:13.470
It's time I taught you a lesson!
Stay right there!

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:14.970
OK, I'm sorry! Whoa, watch out!

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:22.440
It was one of the sisters.
Her insides have been burned out.

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:25.070
I guess an autopsy won't be necessary.

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:30.110
It's an EM Type. And probably not just one.

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:36.790
I wanna warm it up...

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:38.750
Zap!

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:46.750
The rent's so high everywhere!

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:52.300
I think Mariko-san's place was the best.
Let's ask one more time.

00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:56.180
Forget it. Who'd wanna rent
from that stubborn old woman?

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:59.560
Well, you overdid it yesterday too, Mom.

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:01.520
Are you taking her side now?

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:04.190
I'm not taking sides at all.

00:15:04.270 --> 00:15:06.610
I see...

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:11.240
Mariko-san said she rents to businesses.
What does that mean?

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:15.070
It means the room has to be used
as an office or for a business.

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:23.500
Yeah, alright. I'll be right there.

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:29.460
I have to go to a meeting at work.

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:34.890
See you!
Yeah! I'll be back later!

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:37.720
Work, huh?

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:41.390
"Do it all"? That's it!

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:42.640
It's just you?

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:46.190
Yes. The director won't come
unless there's something pressing.

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:48.980
Not that I want to see him.

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:54.700
So, this is the next X-Con
you're after. It's an EM Type.

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:57.030
I already got that one.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:16:00.410
Some models were
mass-produced for test purposes.

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:01.580
Mass-produced?

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:04.870
Yes. Our team will search them out.

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:10.170
Once we find them, they'll call
this phone. It's a special cell phone.

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:14.130
Of course, you might be the first
to discover one sometimes.

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:17.850
If there is an X-Con near you,
your Witchblade will detect it.

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:23.730
That's it for communication.
We're counting on you.

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:28.730
I feel like some kind of subcontractor.

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:33.190
A subcontractor to exterminate X-Cons!
That's a good one!

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:36.450
I don't think it's funny.

00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:37.910
Riko?

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:42.790
Riko? Don't tell me she !

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:48.710
Yeah. I'll decide on that. Thanks.

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:52.380
Hello!

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:56.430
You again?!

00:16:56.510 --> 00:16:58.550
I'm a customer today!

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:02.810
What'll it be?

00:17:02.890 --> 00:17:06.890
Pudding a la mode! With lots of fruit!

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:10.360
Is it on the menu?
Yes.

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:13.820
Wow!

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:16.900
Hey, Missy. Gimme some water... Oh!

00:17:16.990 --> 00:17:19.490
Hey, Rihoko-Chan! I missed you!

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:21.450
Hello, Chou-san!

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:24.660
I-Is your mom with you?
She's...

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:25.790
Riko!

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:29.460
Oh! Mom! I missed
So you did come here!

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:30.330
Mom!

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:33.550
I told you this place is off limits!
Now let's go home!

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:36.800
I like it here!
No is no!

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:38.890
But...
It has to be a business!

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:42.760
Don't worry. I can't rent it to
you now, even if I wanted to.

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:44.850
Oh, come on...

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:49.150
I just got a call from the agent. I decided.

00:17:49.230 --> 00:17:51.770
You decided to rent it out?
Yes.

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:54.280
You decided already?!
Yep.

00:17:54.360 --> 00:17:55.490
Really?!

00:17:55.570 --> 00:18:00.820
You're so persistent! Unlike you,
this one's a legitimate business!

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:03.830
What's the name?!

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:06.250
Do-It-All Amaha.

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:10.500
Wait... That's our name...

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:16.090
Hurray! We did it! Do-It-All
Amaha is actually our company!

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:17.170
Eh?!

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:18.760
Say what?!

00:18:18.840 --> 00:18:21.760
I called the real estate agent and asked!

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:24.930
Mom, it's okay, isn't it?!
Do-it-all handyman work!

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:30.560
Do-it-all? Yeah... it might work!

00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:32.770
Well, since we're now your renters...

00:18:32.860 --> 00:18:34.770
H-Hold on! I !

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:38.650
Looks like you lost this one,
Missy! Contract complete!

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:42.280
Thank you!

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:44.910
Atta way to go!

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:48.910
A sign of disturbance... But not a bad one.

00:18:50.460 --> 00:18:51.960
However!

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:54.750
This building is set to
be demolished in one year.

00:18:54.840 --> 00:18:58.260
So you'd better find new lodgings by then.

00:18:58.340 --> 00:18:59.510
Eh?

00:18:59.590 --> 00:19:05.680
Yup... It's a paradise for just one year.
But one year is a long time!

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:11.440
A mixed residence? She plans to live there?

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:14.440
Well... that's how it turned out.

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:17.650
She's so willful...
You can't talk us out of it!

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:19.740
I'm living here with Riko!

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:22.780
I have no intention of
letting you look after us!

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:24.780
Have you forgotten your work agreement?

00:19:24.870 --> 00:19:28.200
I'll work! But I won't be used!

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:31.410
I'll do your work as a
do-it-all contractor! Got that?!

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:33.750
Probably not...

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:35.710
Fine.

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:38.170
Do as you please.

00:19:38.260 --> 00:19:40.800
Oh... okay.

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:42.470
No way!

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:56.270
Doctor...

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:10.870
You guys are awesome...
Such an awesome smell...

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:13.290
They came right to us.

00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:17.750
If you move around, you can catch them.
That's how easy they are.

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:21.510
I'll warm you up real good!

00:20:21.590 --> 00:20:23.720
Zap!

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:34.980
What is this? I feel it...
It's different from before...

00:20:37.650 --> 00:20:38.770
Masane-san!

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:50.830
Why you !

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:55.290
You're the last one, right?

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:58.250
That's...

00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:15.270
Zap...

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:23.690
Doctor, that's the Witchblade wearer.

00:21:23.780 --> 00:21:25.400
So it would seem.

00:21:25.490 --> 00:21:27.570
What are you?! X-Cons?!

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:33.290
She must be mad to think we're
the same as those scrap heaps.

00:21:33.370 --> 00:21:36.500
She hasn't been told many details.

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:39.710
I suddenly feel really irritated!

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:07.280
I murmur, "I love you," with all my emotion

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:16.620
All my feelings until yesterday now overflow and dissolve quickly

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:28.550
If only this one last prayer could make it through...

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:37.390
Thank you for giving us the words to ascertain each other, God

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:49.400
Tomorrow, we'll reach out and hold hands harder than normal

00:22:49.490 --> 00:23:02.420
Tomorrow, we'll reach out, hug, kiss, and love each other

00:23:12.800 --> 00:23:15.760
We finally found a place to call home!

00:23:15.850 --> 00:23:17.260
We did it!

00:23:17.350 --> 00:23:19.930
Chou-san, Mariko-san, Naomi-chan...

00:23:20.020 --> 00:23:21.810
I love them all!

00:23:21.900 --> 00:23:25.820
Next time, I'm going to make dessert for them!

00:23:25.900 --> 00:23:30.690
Of course, I'll do all
the cooking for you, Mom!

00:23:30.780 --> 00:23:33.950
I want to learn more about cooking, too!

00:23:34.030 --> 00:23:38.580
By the way, what is your job, Mom?
